    "aiDescription": {
      "summary": "The bill creates a \"catastrophic specialty hospital\" designation that exempts qualifying LTCHs from the Medicare 1886(m) payment system. Applies to LTCHs with a 3-year track record of \u226580% spinal-cord or acquired-brain-injury DRG cases, \u2265175 annual SCI and ABI discharges, \u226530% out\u2011of\u2011state admits, plus inpatient/outpatient services and neurorehab research/training.",
