    "impact": {
      "summary": "The bill lets the HHS Secretary label some long term care hospitals as catastrophic specialty hospitals that mainly treat spinal cord or brain injuries. Those designated LTCHs would get Medicare payments outside the LTCH payment system, affecting LTCH operators and Medicare beneficiaries with those conditions.",
